      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 4.14,
          "en": "Now, one suggestion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.14,
          "end": 9.14,
          "en": "which ChatGPT generated here for me when I asked it for SEO",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "is that I should add internal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 15.903,
          "en": "and external links to the article.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 17.723,
          "en": "Now, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.723,
          "end": 22.723,
          "en": "the article that was generated by ChatGPT contains no links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 26.46,
          "en": "And since it suggests itself to include links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 29.88,
          "en": "we should definitely ask it for that, I'd say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.88,
          "end": 33.393,
          "en": "Therefore we could send a message like this to ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 36.39,
          "en": "In this prompt, I'm saying add links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.39,
          "end": 38.22,
          "en": "to other websites to the article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.22,
          "end": 41.493,
          "en": "because that is what it is suggesting itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.33,
          "end": 43.477,
          "en": "For example, in the sentence,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.477,
          "end": 46.65,
          "en": "\"Welcome to the world of ChatGPT,\" and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 50.97,
          "en": "which is a sentence relatively at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.97,
          "end": 54.6,
          "en": "This one here, ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.6,
          "end": 58.74,
          "en": "So the word ChatGPT should be a link to the ChatGPT website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.74,
          "end": 62.01,
          "en": "I think those kinds of links would make a lot of sense here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.01,
          "end": 64.71,
          "en": "And of course, I don't just want to have this link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.71,
          "end": 67.08,
          "en": "but similar links as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.08,
          "end": 68.73,
          "en": "which is why I then also say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.73,
          "end": 73.08,
          "en": "add links for other key concepts or keywords to the article.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.08,
          "end": 75.63,
          "en": "So it should not just link this ChatGPT word,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.63,
          "end": 78.42,
          "en": "but also add more links than that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.42,
          "end": 83.42,
          "en": "So when going ahead and sending this message to ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.67,
          "end": 88.38,
          "en": "it indeed goes back to the article and adds some links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.38,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "And what's really great here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "what's not necessarily always the case though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 95.16,
          "en": "is that here in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.16,
          "end": 99.09,
          "en": "it just gives me the parts that are updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.09,
          "end": 101.1,
          "en": "I guess it basically kept in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
