          "end": 105.27000000000001,
          "en": "that before I asked it to only tell me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.27000000000001,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "which parts should be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.52000000000001,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "when I requested the visuals and images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 114.06,
          "en": "I passed this extra information here to ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.06,
          "end": 115.95,
          "en": "requesting it to only give me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.95,
          "end": 118.74000000000001,
          "en": "the parts of the article that changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.74000000000001,
          "end": 120.75,
          "en": "It seems like it kept this in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.75,
          "end": 123.09,
          "en": "for the links request here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.09,
          "end": 126.33,
          "en": "which therefore leads to a pretty concise answer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.33,
          "end": 130.2,
          "en": "here in my case since it only contains pointers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.2,
          "end": 132.96,
          "en": "at the parts in the article that should be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.96,
          "end": 136.74,
          "en": "and then the actual words that should be linked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 138.72,
          "en": "And of course if we hover over this link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.72,
          "end": 142.35,
          "en": "or right click on it, we could grab that link address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.35,
          "end": 144,
          "en": "and we can, of course, also click on the link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 146.85,
          "en": "to be taken to these different pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.85,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "So with that, I now also get some links in that article,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 154.11,
          "en": "and therefore we have another SEO criteria",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
