          "en": "checked and completed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.55,
          "end": 158.16,
          "en": "because now that we do have some links in the article,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.16,
          "end": 160.95,
          "en": "this article hopefully is more relevant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 162.87,
          "en": "to search engines like Google.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.87,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "And of course, those links in general",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 167.52,
          "en": "also help the readers of our article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.52,
          "end": 170.37,
          "en": "since they allow those readers to dive deeper.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.37,
          "end": 175.37,
          "en": "Now, we could of course request ChatGPT to add more links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.44,
          "end": 179.31,
          "en": "We could also use self-reflective prompting again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.31,
          "end": 181.17,
          "en": "We could, for example, ask,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.17,
          "end": 185.04,
          "en": "are these all the links you can add or something similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.04,
          "end": 187.98,
          "en": "and it would probably come up with more links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.98,
          "end": 192.33,
          "en": "But to also save your time here, I'm not going to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.33,
          "end": 194.91,
          "en": "Of course, feel free to do it on your own though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.91,
